      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Similar issue has occurred with me after regular menu usage. see https://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/unable-to-move-after-adding-world-to-favourites-list and I have sent a support email regarding another time using the menu has caused me to get stuck. This appears to be a new bug. Can I ask you to also send through a support email so that they actually notice this as an issue that is affecting more people.",
