      "value": "@{5ab3ad272b67505f726c2a8f|full_name}: I just sent an email, today it happened again and I managed to have a fairly clear log of the problem, even if I'm not completely sure it's related to the fact that I'm stuck. In any case, before I got stuck there were a lot of error messages regarding the playlists of the worlds, that apparently could not download. I hope that this can help at least a little to fix the problem",
