      "value": "@{5b1447490c6fe33c5d1370a2|full_name}: seems I've found something to this, apparently, if you hear both the 'menu up' and 'menu down' sound at the same time, you are forced to either restart, OR you can get out of the soft-lock by going to the same or a different instance using the menu.\n\nhere's my post about the (potentially) same issue.\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/menu-soft-lock",
