      "value": "@{5b21785df50cde783626bd94|full_name}: unfortunately I have the sound of the menu muted, so I don't know if this could be the problem, but today happened again, I followed what the support told me to do but it seems it didn't work. I just sent an email to them with the log of the session and linked your post to them, so hopefully they can find an answer to this problem. And, btw, what I said in the previous post it's not the cause of this problem, in addition to the fact the support told me so, I saw that error other times days after and I was not stuck, therefore the problem seems that it's not associated to the playlists",
