  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "After the last update I noticed a strange \"bug\", sometimes I go AFK, so I often open the social or world menu and stay on that screen until I get back. Now, every now and then, without any apparent reason, when I leave the menu I'm stuck, I can't move the view with the mouse and I can't move with the keyboard, but when I press the Esc key I see the menu open, but I can't interact with it, so I'm forced to close and reopen vrchat. \nIt's already the third time that happens to me, I don't remember how long I've been AFK these 3 times but I think it happens both when I'm there for a short time and when I'm there for a long time, I was in different worlds when it happened and I don't know if ot can be helpful, but I've always had a generic avatar and, obviously, I'm playing from desktop",
